  "description": "EncryptionClassLib is a robust and flexible C# library designed to simplify the implementation of encryption and decryption in .NET 6 applications.\n                  It provides a unified API for both AES and RijndaelManaged algorithms, supporting 128-bit and 256-bit key sizes.\n                  With built-in key generation, custom key management, and both synchronous and asynchronous methods,\n                  EncryptionClassLib enables developers to securely handle sensitive data with minimal effort.\n                  The library is ideal for any application requiring strong, customizable cryptographic operations,\n                  and is structured for easy integration and reuse across multiple projects.",
